%% WhatsApp MCP + Agent Architecture - zero-cost production stack
%% Flow: paired WhatsApp Web session -> CDP/MCP bridge -> Agent Core -> Tool Belt
%% Zero-cost law: no Business API, no per-message fees, no crawling -
%% session-based MCP control of a real, logged-in browser.
flowchart TD
    subgraph W["LAYER 1 · WHATSAPP WEB — the interface"]
        direction LR
        PHONE["Paired phone<br/>QR scanned once, session stays logged in<br/>the session is the licence — ZERO COST"]
        WA["WhatsApp Web in real Chrome<br/>chats render as ordinary DOM<br/>nothing hidden, nothing special"]
        INBOX["One inbox, all traffic<br/>recruiters · KDP alerts · family threads"]
    end

    subgraph B["LAYER 2 · MCP BRIDGE — the hands (zero-cost control plane)"]
        direction LR
        CDP["chrome-devtools MCP over CDP<br/>reads DOM · clicks · types · screenshots<br/>exposes tools: read_inbox / send_message / check_thread<br/>NO WhatsApp Business API · NO crawling<br/>session-based control of a real browser — the browser is the API"]
    end

    subgraph A["LAYER 3 · AGENT CORE — the brain"]
        direction LR
        INTENT["Intent detector<br/>job reply? KDP update?<br/>family note? escalate?"]
        MEM["Memory<br/>identity rules · project state<br/>past promises: who, what, when"]
        DRAFT["Reply drafter<br/>Kunal's voice: short, warm, precise<br/>pacing law built in"]
    end

    subgraph T["LAYER 4 · TOOL BELT — the reach"]
        direction LR
        WB["whatsapp_send / whatsapp_read<br/>replies go back through the same session"]
        JOBS["Job boards<br/>Naukri · Foundit · LinkedIn<br/>search, apply, follow up"]
        KDP["KDP · files · reports<br/>book status, covers, manuscript"]
        ESC["escalate_to_Kunal<br/>sensitive or unsure = human approves"]
    end

    G["GUARDRAILS — the law every layer obeys<br/>identity law: books ship as NILOY DAS, never Kunal Das · pacing law: no message bursts<br/>messaging-only: no calls, no video · human approval on every sensitive send<br/>no crawling: the logged-in session is the only door in"]

    PHONE --> WA
    WA -->|"messages surface as DOM (zero API cost)"| CDP
    CDP -->|"structured tool calls"| INTENT
    INTENT --> MEM
    MEM --> DRAFT
    DRAFT -->|"approved send only"| WB
    INTENT -.-> JOBS
    INTENT -.-> KDP
    DRAFT -.->|"uncertain / sensitive"| ESC
    ESC -.->|"Kunal says yes or no"| WB
    G -.->|"binds every layer"| A
    G -.-> T

    classDef wa fill:#1F2937,stroke:#111827,color:#FFFFFF
    classDef bridge fill:#1D4ED8,stroke:#1E3A8A,color:#FFFFFF
    classDef agent fill:#15803D,stroke:#14532D,color:#FFFFFF
    classDef tools fill:#EA580C,stroke:#7C2D12,color:#FFFFFF
    classDef guard fill:#7C2D12,stroke:#431407,color:#FFFFFF
    class PHONE,WA,INBOX wa
    class CDP bridge
    class INTENT,MEM,DRAFT agent
    class WB,JOBS,KDP,ESC tools
    class G guard
